WEBVTT

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:29.830
I'm not a robot, I'm a machine, so I know what's going on.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:50.480
to the

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:08.840
Oh, snow, dye the young wise men!

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:19.430
General Angolas! General Dredo!

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:33.910
- General! - We're going out right now.

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:37.330
The Science Fortress Research Institute has been hit hard.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.250
That alone is enough!

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:41.690
We don't need to think of a special strategy.

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:43.460
What do you mean?

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:47.110
We'll change our target at that time.

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:51.260
We'll try to hit the Science Fortress Research Institute as hard as we can.

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:52.980
Even if we go a long way,

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:56.580
we'll stop that Kabuto Kenzo at the end.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:58.180
Yes, sir!

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:00.000
Go!

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:08.600
I won't give you any time to rest!

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:17.530
What's wrong?

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.550
You've already lost more than half of it.

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:20.510
Is that all you've got?

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:22.510
Is he still a man?

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:24.510
I'm going to fall!

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:33.820
You know, they say you can't hide your skin from white.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:36.100
Girls need to be fair-skinned.

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:38.870
I bought a lot of cream.

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:40.300
See? It's just like this.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:41.840
That's not true.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:47.960
Young people nowadays burn their skin just by saying "gum-yake" or "hawai-yake."

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:52.650
That's true, but burning your skin just by saying "gum-yake" and "black" is not the same thing.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:55.180
That's why I'm so thick-skinned.

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:57.170
I wanted to be born white.

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:00.000
I...

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:01.670
I wonder if he can get married.

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:06.370
He was born between a father of a black man and a mother of a Japanese.

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:10.500
This tanned skin won't go away even if you put on make-up.

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:21.530
Oh? I thought you were some kind of a girl.

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:23.200
Young people are so envious.

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:25.710
They become beautiful just by a little thing.

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:30.000
I think you'll be satisfied if you get married.

00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:45.810
No, I don't like it. My skin won't turn white.

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:00.000
Jun, what's wrong?

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:02.640
Did you have a fight with Tetsuya again?

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:07.590
The president is a very funny man, so I was just embarrassed.

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:11.650
I'm sorry, Mr. President.

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:14.400
I see. So that's how it is.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:34.070
I'm envious of this white snow.

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:37.170
I can dye my hair any way I want from now on.

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:40.820
But my skin color and my destiny as an orphan...

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:43.530
have already been stained by it.

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:47.800
A girl must be colorful.

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:56.390
I know it's hard, but you should worry as much as you can.

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:59.920
You'll find the light in the darkness of your heart.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.820
I'll keep an eye on you, Jun.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:06.680
What? Don't you know Jin?

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:08.680
He didn't come to the pool.

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:12.230
I can swim 50 meters now.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.820
I wanted to show Jin.

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:17.220
What? Why are you there?

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:25.470
It's so cold. Why are you standing there?

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:29.860
-What's wrong? -What's wrong?

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:36.550
What's that, Jun?

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:39.410
I'm sorry to go with you.

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:40.950
Sorry, Tetsuya.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:42.510
I was going to go to makeup.

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:44.290
It's nothing.

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:45.360
Well, it's fine.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.160
The woman is so lonely.

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:50.200
I don't know.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.280
I don't know.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.310
I don't know.

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:53.920
I don't know.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:54.830
What?

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:55.830
Did you say something?

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:04.620
We're approaching the Science Fortress!

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:06.810
Mikenes, stop Mikaros!

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:11.860
If you get any closer, you'll get caught by the underwater radar of the Science Fortress Research Lab!

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:14.200
Droid, what are you going to do?

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:17.210
Let's lure out the Great Maginga from Gortoba!

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:22.600
After that, we'll land on Gidonias and rush to the research lab!

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:35.990
Huh? Director, an unidentified object is approaching!

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:38.480
-What? -What?

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:45.110
This is bad. The power plant hasn't been repaired yet.

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:53.300
Don't say such a thing!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:59.280
We're both orphans, but we can't do anything about it even if we hate our parents.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.370
It doesn't matter if your skin is black or white.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:05.220
That's the most important issue for humans.

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:14.360
If you're going to hate me, then hate the fight.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:17.120
If you and I were to hate our parents,

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:19.140
we wouldn't be alive in the dark.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:29.640
Brother, you're wrong.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:33.120
-What? -Idiot.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:37.640
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:40.520
-I heard you, sis. -Sorry.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:44.160
It's fine. You don't understand.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:46.780
Tetsuya doesn't either.

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:50.640
He doesn't understand that I'm a girl.

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:55.060
-He's the chief. -We're fighting from the sea.

00:07:55.060 --> 00:08:00.000
Tetsuya, it's not good to get close to them until the repair of the power room is over.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.960
Boss, the barrier isn't working.

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:05.210
Oh dear, he's showing up without any proof.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.370
All right!

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:10.470
We have to get rid of him as soon as possible.

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:13.190
We have a chance. The snow has stopped.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:56.650
Majin-Go!

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:59.120
The Red Mazinger will fly to the surface of the sea!

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.000
Let's take it down at once!

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:23.560
Get up! Kill him with the sea!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:47.680
Gordova has successfully suppressed the Great Majin Ga!

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:50.610
Did you do it, Gordova?

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:52.610
Bring out Gidonias!

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:54.190
Listen to me, Gidonias!

00:09:54.190 --> 00:10:00.000
Go from the land to the research lab and blow them up!

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:12.090
Tetsuya, you can do it!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.990
Please stop it somehow.

00:10:13.990 --> 00:10:16.040
President, the oxygen meter has dropped.

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:17.990
I knew it, it's in the ocean.

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:21.980
Even so, what on earth has Jiyo done?

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:29.090
What the hell is that?

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:33.530
Chief, we're in trouble!

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.960
A different combat rifle has landed in the city!

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:44.080
It's an attack! Jun, you have to fight back!

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:47.120
You have to deal with the city's combat rifle with your own hands!

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:48.690
Do you hear me, Jun?

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:50.230
Jun!

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:53.460
This battle is a battle for world peace.

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:55.670
Throw away your personal feelings!

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:05.720
Miss Jun's behavior was strange.

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:07.200
Hey, Sensei!

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:09.680
You don't have to worry, Shiro.

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:11.910
I wonder what's going on.

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:16.170
Brother Tetsuya, hurry up and take care of Sendouji!

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:23.370
Those who hate war must hate those who destroy peace the most.

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:28.260
I don't think Jun will understand that.

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:47.380
What? A missile?

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:53.730
The gun has landed.

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:56.200
Two of them.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:58.420
-Please order the connection in order. -Yes, sir!

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:04.360
-Jun! Shiro! -Boss!

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:05.690
What's wrong, Shiro?

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:08.110
I don't know what's wrong with Jun, but he's acting strange.

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:09.540
Give him some strength!

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:19.590
Tetsuya, this battle is also the reason why Koji's fate is in danger.

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:25.540
Even now, there may be someone who will become Koji like us.

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:03.490
What are you doing? Why aren't you fighting?

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:06.340
Are you trying to kill the people around you?

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:08.100
Do you hear me, Jun?

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:18.060
The one who will create peace...

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:20.420
...is you!

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:30.000
Yunus, what's wrong with you?

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:31.060
I don't care about that.

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:33.360
Don't say such a thing.

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:34.510
That's right.

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:37.510
You're trying to kill this cute Byunas?

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:38.460
Now, come on.

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:40.320
I, Boss Bolt, will be your opponent.

00:15:58.330 --> 00:15:59.160
Boss, Byunas has abandoned the battle.

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.000
Boss, Byunas has abandoned the battle.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:00.960
I've been defeated!

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:03.510
Chuu!

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:07.080
Oh!

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:07.900
Boss!

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:09.720
What are you waiting for?

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:10.950
Great Boomerang!

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:16.960
Don't mess with me!

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:20.700
He's here, too.

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:23.300
What? Did he eat Hidemon?

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:28.030
Whoa!

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:48.470
The plan is going well. Stop the Great Majinger!

00:16:48.470 --> 00:16:50.840
Thunder Break!

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:02.050
Gordova!

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:05.130
Damn it!

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:05.960
Doraid!

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:07.510
Let's get rid of Gidonias!

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:09.500
The Great Mazinger is going that way!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:11.270
Gidonias?

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:12.770
Before the Great Mazinger comes,

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:14.770
you must defeat such a crazy robot!

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:26.620
We can't defeat him!

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:27.630
Paisu!

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:29.130
That's impossible!

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:30.000
That round butt...

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:33.410
I can't move!

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:35.790
Hot! Hot! Hot!

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:42.720
Get ready, Gidonias!

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:46.680
Destroy him and head to the Science and Technology Research Institute!

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:49.290
Yes!

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:50.290
This bastard is coming!

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:51.300
Get ready!

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:56.250
Yes!

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:57.250
Whoa!

00:17:57.250 --> 00:17:58.200
Wait for me!

00:17:58.200 --> 00:17:59.670
Whoa!

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:11.110
We have to bring him back!

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:11.970
All right!

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:25.260
God, listen to my wish.

00:18:25.260 --> 00:18:27.440
I can't fight.

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:30.000
Even if I can defeat that fighter,

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:32.330
I don't want my skin to be white.

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:36.380
Even if I come back, my suffering will not change.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:39.200
Please, let me change.

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:43.670
Jun, would you be saved only one?

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:47.050
You should have a lot of brothers like you.

00:18:47.050 --> 00:18:50.860
But they don't have the power to fight like you.

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:55.370
You are the leader of evil.

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:57.370
But I...

00:18:57.370 --> 00:18:58.870
Ah, Jun!

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:05.460
Jun, this is bad! The Great Maginot is in danger!

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:06.920
Hurry up and get him!

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:13.410
-Hey, Jun! -Jun!

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:19.120
Jun, Tsurugi Tetsuya is doing his best not to lose to his allies.

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:21.920
Now that God has given you life,

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:25.140
you should fight against evil with everything you have.

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:29.660
That is the hope of allies like you.

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:34.960
Jun, help the Great Majinga!

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:40.050
I hate Tetsuya, but I'm not saying that right now!

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:42.150
Jun, what are you going to do?

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:44.050
Are you going to leave me alone?

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:49.080
Mr. Jun. Mr. Jun.

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:51.890
If you really love peace,

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:54.870
you must stop doing evil things.

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:57.560
Now is the time to get angry and stand up.

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:00.000
Even if you're alone,

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:03.640
I can't give out the victims of the war.

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:10.940
I can't give out people like me among the people who were wandering around in the city.

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:15.240
Hey, Jun, where are you going?

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:16.340
Don't stop him.

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:19.810
God's heart has already passed on to that person.

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:25.930
Tetsuya, wait.

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:30.000
I'm going to be the representative of the people who hate war and fight.

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.160
I'll fight with you.

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:34.390
It was my duty to be born in this world.

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:36.370
The color of your skin is not a problem.

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:38.620
Jun, you understand, don't you?

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:40.850
I'll do my best.

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:49.010
Jun, destroy the rocket launch device during the battle.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.010
I understand.

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:52.010
Hot!

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:54.740
Hot!

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:15.060
Huh? It hurts!

00:21:15.060 --> 00:21:16.110
Wait!

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:18.400
Ju, watch out!

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:20.650
Tetsuya, let me do it!

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:21.410
Idiot!

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:22.900
I'm not your opponent!

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:24.540
I can't let you say that!

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:25.990
I want to see Kojiro!

00:21:32.780 --> 00:21:34.330
You did it, Toh!

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:53.350
Mazinger Blade!

00:21:53.350 --> 00:21:57.010
It was just one hit, but...

00:21:57.010 --> 00:21:58.510
That's Ryunas!

00:21:58.510 --> 00:22:00.000
He's the one who took over all of Keisei!

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:01.380
I've changed my mind!

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:02.530
Idiot!

00:22:02.530 --> 00:22:04.480
What kind of commander are you?

00:22:04.480 --> 00:22:07.840
You're trying to catch me, but you won't let me finish you off!

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:09.700
I'm sorry!

00:22:09.700 --> 00:22:24.060
Are you angry?

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:26.650
Haha, I don't have time for that.

00:22:26.650 --> 00:22:29.830
Damn it, I'm too nervous.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:33.750
If you try to cool your head a little, you'll find yourself in trouble.

00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:35.890
You mean me?

00:22:35.890 --> 00:22:37.270
I'm sorry.

00:22:37.270 --> 00:22:39.790
I was watching the sunset of the Silver World.

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:42.010
This guy is so cool.

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:51.750
Are you watching?

00:22:51.750 --> 00:22:56.010
That snow is burning like your young father dyed it.

00:22:56.010 --> 00:22:57.860
That's the color of youth.

00:22:57.860 --> 00:22:59.380
It's the color of humans.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.410
It's your color.

00:23:43.880 --> 00:23:45.140
I heard it

00:24:31.470 --> 00:24:35.110
The Dark Grand Shogun sends out the new battleship Graval and Marbalas...

00:24:35.210 --> 00:24:36.950
to attack the science fortress research facility.

00:24:36.970 --> 00:24:39.190
And then, Mikenes and the others who flew out of Graval...

00:24:39.290 --> 00:24:43.000
finally break into the research facility and send a time bomb to the energy tank.

00:24:43.080 --> 00:24:45.130
Meanwhile, the Great Majinger, which has been expanding...

00:24:45.230 --> 00:24:47.930
the vast space-time line against the battleships...

00:24:48.030 --> 00:24:50.040
is about to explode.

00:24:50.180 --> 00:24:52.050
Next time, on Great Majinger...

00:24:52.060 --> 00:24:55.990
Please look forward to Mikenes' attack and invasion!
